# dist/ — illustrative only.
#
# In a real project this directory would be GITIGNORED and would never
# contain a tracked file. We're tracking this `.gitkeep` solely so the
# template ships the *layout* (showing readers where compiled output
# lives next to `src/`).
#
# When you adopt this template:
#   1. Delete this `.gitkeep`.
#   2. Make sure `dist/` is matched by your `.gitignore`.
#   3. Let your build (`tsc`, `vite build`, `rollup -c`, etc.) populate
#      it locally; never commit the result.
#
# See ../README.md and the project-level .gitignore for the full layout
# the policy expects.
